      "description": "The meme references the real-world issue of underreporting of sexual violence, particularly against Muslim women, which is often attributed to systemic barriers, social stigma, and cultural norms. The meme falsely implies that the low reporting rate is due to inherent characteristics of the Muslim community, rather than structural or societal factors.",
