      "description": "The meme uses the broader context of Islamophobic tropes that portray Muslim communities as inherently violent, untruthful, or culturally backward. These tropes are used to delegitimize the experiences of Muslim victims and to perpetuate the idea that the community is inherently untruthful or unreporting due to cultural or religious reasons.",
