      "label": "hateful anger expressed through degrading analogy",
      "description": "The meme expresses hateful anger by using a degrading and false analogy ('goats can't talk') to imply that Muslim men are incapable of reporting sexual violence, which is a form of Islamophobic hate speech. The visual of a large crowd of men with raised hands, combined with the text, conveys a sense of aggressive dismissal and contempt for Muslim victims.",
